==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|is|spurja||pronunciation spelling|proscribed}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|spyrja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*spurjaną}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|spyrian}}, {{cog|de|spüren}}, {{cog|da|spørge}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈspɪrja/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|ɪrja|s=2}}
* {{IPA|is|/ˈspʏrja/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ʏrja|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|spurði|spurt}}

# to [[ask]]

====Usage notes====
* It is very common to pronounce {{m|is|spyrja}} as if written {{m|is|spurja}}, and this spelling is also common, though proscribed.
* The imperative form '''spurðu''' is also particularly common alongside '''spyrðu'''. Compare '''keyptu''' (of {{m|is|kaupa}}).

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-w3|sp|y|r|j|a}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|is|spurn}}

